# 统一换行策略：仓库内一律 LF，检出到工作区也保持 LF。
# 用属性文件显式声明，优先级高于 core.autocrlf，避免 Git 弹出
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 这类警告，也避免行尾来回抖动。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制制品：禁止任何行尾/文本转换
*.xlsx binary
*.xlsm binary
*.xls  binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.exe  binary
*.bin  binary

# Windows 批处理与 PowerShell 脚本按平台习惯保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
